# CoinPicks Research Engine — optional keys
#
# Copy this file to `.env` in this same folder, then fill in only what you want.
#
# NOTHING HERE IS REQUIRED TO RUN THE ENGINE. All of its market data (GeckoTerminal,
# CoinGecko, DexScreener, DefiLlama, on-chain RPC, TON) is free and needs no key at all.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# X (Twitter) — turns on founder and social research
# Used by: .claude/skills/social-research/
#
# WHAT IT BUYS YOU
#   The Team section of every report gets the half that market data cannot give you: the
#   project's VERIFIED X account (impersonators are routine, so this matters), who the
#   founder actually is, and what they have said recently. Without this key that section
#   rests on LinkedIn and primary sources, and your report says the social checks were
#   skipped rather than pretending it looked.
#
# WHAT IT COSTS
#   X bills PER READ, from the first call. You need a free X account, an app at
#   https://developer.x.com, and a few dollars of pay-per-use credit. You do NOT need
#   X Premium. The skill caps itself at $1.50 per coin and resolves handles from free
#   sources first, so most lookups cost nothing at all.
#
# WHERE IT GOES
#   Paste your own bearer token after the = below. It stays in this file, on your machine,
#   and is only ever sent to api.x.com. Never paste it into a chat with anyone, including
#   your AI assistant.
X_BEARER_TOKEN=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Speed-ups and extra sources. All optional, all free tiers. See TROUBLESHOOT.md,
# "I do heavy research and want searches to go faster".

# CoinGecko free Demo key. Lifts the shared public limit (~10-15 calls/min per IP, which
# parallel research agents blow through instantly) to ~30/min and 10k/month. You can put
# SEVERAL keys here comma-separated and the server rotates them round-robin to multiply the
# limit. Free at https://www.coingecko.com/en/api
# COINGECKO_API_KEY=

# Only set this if you are paying for a CoinGecko PRO key, not a free Demo key.
# COINGECKO_PRO=1

# CoinMarketCap free Basic key. Turns on the three cmc_* tools (an extra cross-check source);
# without it they simply stay off. The key is on your account Overview page at
# https://pro.coinmarketcap.com/account, shown as asterisks - hover to reveal it.
# NOTE the exact name: the server reads CMC_API_KEY. It SENDS it as the X-CMC_PRO_API_KEY
# header, which is CoinMarketCap's header name, not the variable name. Easy to get wrong.
# CMC_API_KEY=
